th rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/11/dutch-bros-inc-bros-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"BROS 2022 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2022-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joth Ricci","x":"We try to keep a long-term perspective when we choose to take price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/dutch-bros-inc-bros-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"BROS 2022 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2022-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joth Ricci","x":"In September, we completed a 4.4% price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/dutch-bros-inc-bros-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"BROS 2022 Q4","e":"bros","d":"2023-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charley Jemley","x":"We elected to take a measured approach to menu price increases during the year, maintaining a loyal and healthy customer base who views us as a good value for the money is paramount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/23/dutch-bros-bros-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2022 Q4","e":"bros","d":"2023-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charley Jemley","x":"And at this point, given that we just refresh rewards, we take prices in typically in two windows in the spring and the fall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/23/dutch-bros-bros-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charley Jemley","x":"We executed a price increase on product sold to our franchisees in Q3 of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"And so, as we took price increases last year that sometimes can take a little bit of time to come out of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charley Jemley","x":"Going into 2023, it was not our intention to take price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"Yes, so one of the reasons why we took price was really to set up this long-term pricing architecture in the right way and so a little more than half of the pricing increase was to make moves in pricing tiers and customizations or modifiers and so about 2.5% of that price is actually for those…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2023-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charley Jemley","x":"We had high single-digit positive pricing, about 100 bps of positive from discount mix net.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/dutch-bros-bros-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2023-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Bernstein","x":"I think you noted a little bit of easing from the second quarter to the third quarter, oftentimes in conjunction with that price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/dutch-bros-bros-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2023 Q4","e":"bros","d":"2024-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jeff Farmer","x":"And unrelated, a little bit of a pivot here, just moving back to the potential California price increase that would come in spring of 2024, are you guys looking to protect dollar profit or are you looking to protect margin?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/21/dutch-bros-bros-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2024-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Sharon Zackfia","x":"Because I think you did not take price and correct me if I'm wrong.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2024-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Bernstein","x":"I know you mentioned that -- well, there was reference to price increases that you did or did not take in California.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2024-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"Even when taking into consideration what remains an uncertain and evolving consumer backdrop, the strong start to 2024 gives us the confidence to raise our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2024-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"Our existing kitchen display nets are compatible with the system, leading to streamline integration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2024-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Josh Guenser","x":"For the quarter, SG&A was approximately $58 million, which includes about $7 million in organizational realignment and restructuring costs and $3 million in stock-based compensation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2024-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"Given the strength we saw in the quarter, and our growing momentum, we will be raising our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/dutch-bros-bros-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2024 Q4","e":"bros","d":"2025-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris O'Cull","x":"Or are there some other cost savings as well?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/dutch-bros-bros-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2025 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"We are raising our full-year guidance for total revenues and same-shop sales growth, reflecting the confidence in the long-term durability of our model and the effectiveness of our transaction-driving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/dutch-bros-bros-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2025 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joshua Guenser","x":"In light of our strong performance throughout the third quarter and into October, we are raising our full-year guidance for total revenues and system same-shop sales growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/dutch-bros-bros-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christine Barone","x":"Based on the strength of our performance throughout Q1, our industry-leading value proposition, and performance into Q2, we are raising our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q1","e":"bros","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joshua Guenser","x":"Given the strong performance throughout Q1 and performance we have seen thus far in Q2, we are raising our full-year guidance in the following areas: Total revenues are now projected to be between $2.05 billion and $2.08 billion, representing 25% to 27% growth year over year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/dutch-bros-bros-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joshua Guenser","x":"As other concepts continue to rightsize their drive through fleet, they are creating even more opportunities for us to expand into high quality locations with exceptional long term economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joshua Guenser","x":"Given the performance we have seen thus far, and the impact of the Phoenix franchise acquisition, we are raising our 2026 guidance in the following areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q2","e":"bros","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Christine Barone","x":"Based on our performance so far this year, and the recent acquisition of 1 of our Phoenix franchisees, we are raising our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/dutch-bros-bros-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joshua Guenser","x":"Beverage food and packaging costs were 25.6% of company-operated shop revenue, which is 30 basis points favorable year-over-year, primarily driven by the collection of approximately $4 million in tariff refunds, partially offset by the costs associated with the new food program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/dutch-bros-bros-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BROS 2026 Q3","e":"bros","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joshua Guenser","x":"This reflects both our typical seasonal mix shift as well as the absence of